            "accordion": {
              "type": "accordion",
              "settings": {
                "icon": "plus",
                "dividers": true,
                "type_preset": "paragraph",
                "border": "none",
                "border_width": 1,
                "border_opacity": 100,
                "border_radius": 0,
                "padding-block-start": 8,
                "padding-block-end": 8,
                "padding-inline-start": 0,
                "padding-inline-end": 0
              },
              "blocks": {
                "row_delivery": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Delivery & what arrives",
                    "open_by_default": true,
                    "icon": "truck",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Free delivery to any UK mainland address, with no minimum spend. Express Dispatch beds leave us in 1–3 working days; everything else within 4. We email tracking as soon as it ships, and the courier contacts you in advance with your delivery day.</p><p>Delivery is by specialist large-item courier <strong>to your front door</strong>. Someone over 18 needs to be in to receive it. The bed arrives flat-packed in protective packaging, with clear assembly instructions and all fittings included.</p><p>Northern Ireland, the Scottish Highlands and UK islands: please email us before ordering and we'll confirm your postcode and any additional cost.</p>",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0,
                        "max_width": "none",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "wrap": "pretty"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text"
                  ]
                },
                "row_specs": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Materials & construction",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "ruler",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Full dimensions, fabric and construction details for this bed are listed in the description above. Every bed ships flat-packed with all fittings included.</p>",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0,
                        "max_width": "none",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "wrap": "pretty"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text"
                  ]
                },
                "row_returns": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Returns & damage",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "return",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>You have 30 days from delivery to tell us the bed isn't right. It needs to be unused, in original condition and original packaging — so keep the packaging until you're sure. We'll quote the collection cost before you confirm anything and deduct it from your refund, or you can arrange your own tracked courier. Refunds are issued within 14 days of the bed reaching us.</p><p>Damaged in transit, or a part missing? Email azixparz@outlook.com within 48 hours with photos and your order number. We'll send a replacement part, a full replacement or a full refund — and collection for faulty goods is arranged and paid for by us. Your rights under the Consumer Rights Act 2015 are unaffected.</p>",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0,
                        "max_width": "none",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "wrap": "pretty"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "row_delivery",
                "row_specs",
                "row_returns"
              ]
