        "heading": "Why people buy from a specialist",
        "text": "<p>We sell beds and nothing else. That means the size guide is right, the delivery is handled by a courier who moves large items every day, and if something arrives damaged you speak to someone who knows the product rather than a general call centre.</p>",
        "button_label": "See all beds",
